    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong meets ancient combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Warriors Waifus Mahjong, you\u2019ll face off against legendary female warriors from across time and cultures! Each level pits you against one of these fierce fighters in a unique Mahjong puzzle battle. With 60 levels of intense gameplay, your strategic skills and quick thinking will be tested as you race against the clock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail to complete the puzzle before time runs out, and you\u2019ll be the laughingstock of the ancient world\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed, and these proud warriors will gradually reveal their true selves to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching 3 gameplay (mahjong)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD artwork of the warriors to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different waifus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchestral Soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong meets ancient combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Warriors Waifus Mahjong, you\u2019ll face off against legendary female warriors from across time and cultures! Each level pits you against one of these fierce fighters in a unique Mahjong puzzle battle. With 60 levels of intense gameplay, your strategic skills and quick thinking will be tested as you race against the clock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail to complete the puzzle before time runs out, and you\u2019ll be the laughingstock of the ancient world\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed, and these proud warriors will gradually reveal their true selves to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching 3 gameplay (mahjong)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD artwork of the warriors to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different waifus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchestral Soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
